# Multitasking P-b (task 015 section 5): the display suspended mode of the supervised fullscreen path, with the real
# display backend. The launcher hands the panel to an app (display_handoff::enter_app_front), keeps its loop alive
# but writes no pixel (a toast and a forced refresh draw nothing over the app's frame), takes the panel back with a
# full repaint (identical to before), and puts the app's last frame back from a snapshot (cp0_display_fb_restore).
# Review-only: the checks are the expect lines; the two shots are the home grid before and after.
title multitask handoff
review
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
home
shot handoff_home
handoff enter
expect_fb paused
handoff paint
toast Never drawn while an app is in front
expect_fb painted
handoff snapshot
toast off
handoff leave
expect_same handoff_home
handoff enter
handoff enter
expect_fb paused
handoff restore
expect_fb painted
handoff leave
handoff leave
expect_same handoff_home
shot handoff_home_after
